# Route: guide 25 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 48 to
# 50, 10 quests, 0.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Hillsbrad Foothills): Tarren Mill -> Durnholde Keep -> Tarren Mill ->
# Hillsbrad Fields -> Azurelode Mine -> Southshore -> Tarren Mill.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Crown of Will (518; Crushridge
# Mauler 36-37).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Grave Knight (96986).

step Melisara
  tip Crushridge Mauler (level 36-37) is elite: grouping up is advised unless you are well above level 37.
  accept 518 optional
  accept 566
  turnin 2933
  accept 2934
  turnin 1065
  accept 1066

